('lst_camera_a6400_body','secondhand','APS-C Mirrorless Body, Approximately 20,000 Shutter Count','Guangzhou City','Tianhe District','Tiyu West','386000',NULL,NULL,'Line 3·Tiyu Xilu Station','{"condition":"85% new","shutter_count":21840}','Slight edge wear on the body, with no obvious dust spots on the sensor. Includes the original battery and charger.','["Front of body","Wear on bottom","Shutter screenshot"]',NULL,NULL,'active','2026-05-18T10:20:00+08:00'),
('lst_camera_xt30_body','secondhand','Retro Mirrorless Body, Silver-and-Black Colorway','Guangzhou City','Yuexiu District','Dongshankou','468000',NULL,NULL,'Line 1·Dongshankou Station','{"condition":"90% new","shutter_count":12600}','The dials have normal resistance, the screen protector is still installed, and the camera has never been repaired. The box and body numbers match.','["Silver-and-black body","Dials","Box label"]',NULL,NULL,'active','2026-05-22T16:05:00+08:00'),
('lst_camera_35mm_lens','secondhand','35mm F1.8 Autofocus Lens','Guangzhou City','Haizhu District','Jiangnan West','156000',NULL,NULL,'Line 2·Jiangnan Xilu Station','{"condition":"88% new","mount":"E"}','The glass is clear and fungus-free, the lens hood has scuff marks, and focusing is quiet. Includes front and rear caps.','["Front element","Rear element","Lens hood"]',NULL,NULL,'active','2026-05-26T09:18:00+08:00'),
('lst_camera_85mm_lens','secondhand','85mm F1.8 Portrait Lens','Guangzhou City','Panyu District','Wanbo','238000',NULL,NULL,'Line 7·Nancun Wanbo Station','{"condition":"92% new","mount":"E"}','No impact marks on the lens barrel, clean aperture blades, and the minimum-focus-distance test is normal.','["Lens barrel","Lens glass","Test sample"]',NULL,NULL,'active','2026-05-30T14:42:00+08:00'),
('lst_camera_flash','secondhand','Round-Head On-Camera Flash with Wireless Trigger','Guangzhou City','Baiyun District','Sanyuanli','92000',NULL,NULL,'Line 2·Sanyuanli Station','{"condition":"80% new","ttl":true}','The flash head rotates smoothly, the battery compartment has no leakage, and the trigger range is stable indoors.','["Flash head","Battery compartment","Wireless trigger"]',NULL,NULL,'active','2026-06-02T19:26:00+08:00'),
('lst_camera_tripod','secondhand','Carbon-Fiber Travel Tripod, Reverse-Folding Design','Guangzhou City','Liwan District','Chen Clan Academy','128000',NULL,NULL,'Line 1·Chen Clan Academy Station','{"condition":"85% new","max_load_kg":8}','The leg locks work normally, the center column shows signs of use, and a short center column and tripod bag are included.','["Deployed","Leg locks","Center column"]',NULL,NULL,'active','2026-06-05T11:10:00+08:00'),
('lst_camera_monitor','secondhand','Five-Inch On-Camera Monitor','Guangzhou City','Tianhe District','Gangding','116000',NULL,NULL,'Line 3·Gangding Station','{"condition":"90% new","input":"HDMI"}','The screen has no dead pixels, false color and peaking work normally, and a sun hood is included.','["Powered-on display","Ports","Sun hood"]',NULL,NULL,'active','2026-05-14T15:33:00+08:00'),
('lst_camera_recorder','secondhand','Dual-Track Portable Recorder','Guangzhou City','Haizhu District','Kecun','78000',NULL,NULL,'Line 3·Kecun Station','{"condition":"82% new","tracks":2}','The knobs and XLR ports work normally. There are scratches on the side of the body. Memory card not included.','["Front","Ports","Scratches"]',NULL,NULL,'active','2026-05-20T08:47:00+08:00'),
('lst_camera_led_panel','secondhand','Bi-Color LED Light Panels, Two-Light Kit','Guangzhou City','Huangpu District','Science City','142000',NULL,NULL,'Line 6·Xiangang Station','{"condition":"88% new","lights":2}','Both lights have matching brightness, the diffusion panels are intact, and one knob on one light stand has been replaced.','["Both lights powered on","Diffusion panels","Light-stand knob"]',NULL,NULL,'active','2026-05-24T18:12:00+08:00'),
('lst_camera_gimbal','secondhand','Three-Axis Mirrorless Gimbal, Standard Kit','Guangzhou City','Panyu District','University Town','165000',NULL,NULL,'Line 4·University Town North Station','{"condition":"86% new","payload_kg":2.6}','The three-axis motors make no abnormal noise, the quick-release plate is included, and there is slight wear on the bottom of the handle.','["Folded","Quick-release plate","Bottom of handle"]',NULL,NULL,'active','2026-05-28T12:55:00+08:00'),
('lst_camera_sd_cards','secondhand','High-Speed 128GB SD Cards, Two-Pack','Guangzhou City','Yuexiu District','Beijing Road','62000',NULL,NULL,'Line 6·Beijing Road Station','{"condition":"Normal health","capacity_gb":256}','Both cards have completed full-disk write tests. Photos of the serial numbers are available. Sold only as a set.','["Two cards","Speed-test screenshot","Serial numbers"]',NULL,NULL,'active','2026-06-01T21:08:00+08:00'),
('lst_camera_backpack','secondhand','20L Black Camera Backpack','Guangzhou City','Haizhu District','Pazhou','68000',NULL,NULL,'Line 8·Pazhou Station','{"condition":"90% new","capacity_l":20}','All padded dividers are included, the back-mesh fabric has no damage, and the rain cover is unused.','["Front","Interior","Rain cover"]',NULL,NULL,'active','2026-05-12T10:36:00+08:00'),
('lst_camera_light_meter','secondhand','Handheld Incident Light Meter','Guangzhou City','Liwan District','Shamian','108000',NULL,NULL,'Line 6·Cultural Park Station','{"condition":"85% new","battery":"AA"}','The lumisphere has no yellowing. Compared with the studio reference meter, the error is less than one-third of a stop.','["Meter body","Lumisphere","Comparison reading"]',NULL,NULL,'active','2026-05-16T17:24:00+08:00'),
('lst_camera_color_chart','secondhand','Portable Mini Color Chart','Guangzhou City','Tianhe District','Zhujiang New Town','36000',NULL,NULL,'Line 5·Zhujiang New Town Station','{"condition":"Lightly used","panels":24}','There are no fingerprints on the color patches, the case hinge works normally, and the production batch is shown on the back.','["Color patches","Case","Batch"]',NULL,NULL,'active','2026-05-21T13:02:00+08:00'),
('lst_camera_battery_set','secondhand','Three Mirrorless Batteries with Dual Charger','Guangzhou City','Baiyun District','Jiahewanggang','54000',NULL,NULL,'Line 2·Jiahewanggang Station','{"condition":"Different cycle counts","batteries":3}','The three batteries have different runtimes. The seller provides individual health screenshots and a dual-charger test.','["Three batteries","Health","Dual charger"]',NULL,NULL,'active','2026-05-25T09:44:00+08:00'),
('lst_camera_filter_kit','secondhand','67mm ND and CPL Filter Set','Guangzhou City','Huangpu District','Yuzhu','47000',NULL,NULL,'Line 5·Yuzhu Station','{"condition":"90% new","diameter_mm":67}','The filters have no obvious scratches, the ND adjustment ring turns smoothly, and a storage pouch is included.','["Filter set","Filter surfaces","Storage pouch"]',NULL,NULL,'active','2026-05-31T15:16:00+08:00'),
('lst_camera_macro_rail','secondhand','Four-Way Macro Focusing Rail with Head','Guangzhou City','Panyu District','Shiqiao','58000',NULL,NULL,'Line 3·Shiqiao Station','{"condition":"88% new","travel_mm":100}','The gear drive has no obvious backlash, and the quick-release clamp is compatible with the Arca standard.','["Rail overall","Gear","Clamp"]',NULL,NULL,'active','2026-06-04T18:30:00+08:00'),
('lst_camera_dry_cabinet','secondhand','50L Electronic Dry Cabinet','Guangzhou City','Haizhu District','Chigang','72000',NULL,NULL,'Line 8·Chigang Station','{"condition":"85% new","capacity_l":50}','The humidity display differs from the independent meter by approximately 3%. The door seal is intact. Pickup only.','["Cabinet","Humidity display","Door seal"]',NULL,NULL,'active','2026-06-07T10:48:00+08:00'),
('lst_camera_printer','secondhand','A3+ Photo Printer','Guangzhou City','Tianhe District','Yuancun','286000',NULL,NULL,'Line 5·Yuancun Station','{"condition":"80% new","nozzles":"test_ok"}','The nozzle check is complete, the maintenance tank is 42% full, and the ink batches vary. Test page included.','["Printer","Nozzle test","Ink status"]',NULL,NULL,'active','2026-06-09T14:06:00+08:00'),
('lst_camera_slider','secondhand','80cm Manual Camera Slider','Guangzhou City','Foshan City','Qiandeng Lake','88000',NULL,NULL,'Guangfo Line·Qiandeng Lake Station','{"condition":"87% new","length_cm":80}','The slider moves smoothly, the feet at both ends are adjustable, and there is one shallow mark on the rail.','["Full length","Slider","Shallow mark on rail"]',NULL,NULL,'active','2026-06-11T16:40:00+08:00');
